4. `handleInterruptedReworkFlow(ticketKey, customParams, tracker, branchName, statuses, fixSummary, params)`? The interrupted block returns either action(params) recursion or handleInterruptedRework(...). To keep action lean, helper returns {resume:true} or {result: ...}:
