The current flow:
1. log 'Checking for merge conflicts with origin/X...' (+ workingDir suffix)
2. ensureRemoteBranchRef
3. shallow probe → maybe unshallow + log
4. `git merge origin/X --no-commit --no-ff`
5. quiet diff probe → stagedChanges boolean; if non-exit-1 failure → warn 'git diff --cached --quiet failed (assuming staged):', msg
6. log staged vs up-to-date; return []
7. catch mergeError:
